# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TourReady Operator — Environment Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# The platform is FULLY FUNCTIONAL WITHOUT an API key. Scenario grading falls
# back to a deterministic, offline keyword + named-technique engine so the
# trainer works reliably on a venue laptop with no connectivity.
#
# Add an Anthropic API key ONLY to unlock nuanced, instructor-style AI feedback
# and the conversational AI Safety Tutor.
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# 2. Paste your key below
# 3. Restart `npm run dev`
#
# Get a key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional — override the model used for grading & the tutor.
# Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-6 (fast, high-quality).
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
